        <mxCell id="legend-bg" style="verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;shape=mxgraph.basic.rect;fillColor2=none;strokeWidth=1;size=20;indent=5;fillColor=light-dark(#EDF3FF,#305363);strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="30" width="620" height="436" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-container" connectable="0" style="group" value="" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1540" y="55" width="580" height="396" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="92" width="580" x="0" y="0" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="1" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend"><mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;One app per pattern&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Each directory under patterns/ is a CDK app you deploy on its own. Every app ends in the same hello-world MCP server; they differ in the origin and in how it is locked to CloudFront.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend"><mxGeometry height="92" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="110" width="580" x="0" y="92" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="2" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend"><mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;The same edge in every app&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;A CloudFront-scope web ACL with the MCP rule stack from the AWS blog (IP reputation, rate limits per IP, initialize and tool, Bot Control, body size, protocol version, tool allowlist, SSRF, SQLi and XSS in arguments), and a viewer-request CloudFront Function that pre-filters tokens.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend"><mxGeometry height="110" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="92" width="580" x="0" y="202" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="3" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend"><mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Four origin locks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;A WAF-checked secret header on a public AgentCore Gateway; a VPC origin into a private network (API Gateway, EKS), with a regional web ACL where the origin takes one; OAC with SigV4 on a Lambda Web Function.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend"><mxGeometry height="92" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="92" width="580" x="0" y="294" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="4" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend"><mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;One Cognito issuer per app&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Each app has its own user pool issuing client-credentials tokens with one scope. The edge decodes; the origin verifies the signature and the scope.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend"><mxGeometry height="92" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
